 maxLines="1"><![CDATA[模糊的是背后已绘制的内容，用来做毛玻璃；背后没有内容时没有可见效果，通常配]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="4330" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[ClipRect/ClipRRect 限定区域。]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="4370" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[四层验证由稳到脆：布局断言 → 像素采样 → Golden 比对 → 人工 Artifact；采样点避开抗锯齿边缘，能]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="4410" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[用布局断言证明的行为不用 Golden。可复现要点：固定字体与 Surface、网络图转本地、不把时间/随]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="4450" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="24" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[机数/机器路径写进图；日常用 verify，有意改变视觉才 update，更新前人工看 diff。]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="4490" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="26" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[ImageFiltered：子树高斯模糊]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="4530" width="1300" height="40"><Container color="transparent" alignment="TOP_LEFT"><Text fontSize="26" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="false" maxLines="1"><![CDATA[ColorFiltered：子树颜色混合]]></Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="10" top="4570" width="1300" height="40"><Conta